EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant
Project Design
The Project Design phase converts the requirements of EduGenie into a technical blueprint showing how the system will be structured, how users interact with it, how data flows through the application, and how Google Gemini is integrated.
________________________________________
1. Project Design Overview
EduGenie is designed as a web-based AI learning assistant with Google Gemini as its generative-AI engine.
The overall design follows:
User → EduGenie Application → Backend → Gemini AI → Personalized Learning Response
The system combines AI tutoring with:
•	Personalized learning
•	Study planning
•	Quiz generation
•	Learning-material summarization
•	Progress tracking
•	Recommendations
________________________________________
2. Design Goals
The system design should achieve the following:
1.	Provide a simple student-friendly interface.
2.	Separate frontend, backend, AI, and database responsibilities.
3.	Keep Gemini API credentials secure.
4.	Maintain relevant conversation context.
5.	Support personalized learning.
6.	Allow future expansion.
7.	Handle AI/API failures gracefully.
8.	Protect student data.
9.	Provide responsive performance.
10.	Support future multimodal and multilingual capabilities.
