26. Security Design
Security should be incorporated into the architecture rather than added later.
Authentication
•	Secure password hashing
•	Session/token management
•	Logout support
Authorization
Users should only access their own:
•	Conversations
•	Quiz results
•	Study plans
•	Profile information
API Security
•	Store Gemini credentials in server-side environment variables/secrets.
•	Validate requests.
•	Apply rate limiting where appropriate.
•	Avoid exposing internal API errors.
Data Security
•	Encrypt sensitive data in transit.
•	Use HTTPS.
•	Apply database access controls.
•	Minimize stored personal information.
________________________________________
