Topic = Binary Search
Level = Beginner
Step 5
Backend constructs the educational prompt.
Step 6
Prompt is sent to Gemini.
Step 7
Gemini generates an explanation.
Step 8
EduGenie displays:
•	Definition
•	Example
•	Step-by-step explanation
•	Complexity
•	Practice question
Step 9
Student selects:
Generate Quiz
Step 10
Gemini generates practice questions.
Step 11
Student completes the quiz.
Step 12
System calculates the result.
Step 13
Progress is saved.
Step 14
EduGenie recommends additional practice if appropriate.
This creates the complete:
Learn → Practice → Evaluate → Improve
cycle.
