Project Design Conclusion
EduGenie is designed as a modular, three-tier, Gemini-powered learning platform. The frontend provides the student experience, the backend manages authentication, business logic, personalization and secure AI communication, while the database stores relevant learning information. Google Gemini provides the generative-AI capabilities needed for tutoring, explanations, summarization, quiz generation, and study planning.
The design therefore provides a clear foundation for the next development stages: database implementation, UI prototyping, API development, Gemini integration, and testing.
